UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Garki stands as one of Abuja''s most established and central districts, embodying a perfect blend of residential comfort and significant commercial activity. Located at the heart of the FCT, it''s easily identifiable by its well-maintained infrastructure and diverse offerings. This prestigious area hosts numerous government offices, corporate headquarters, upscale hotels, and a wide array of retail establishments, from modern shopping malls to bustling local markets like Garki Modern Market. Its residential zones offer a mix of housing options, while its commercial vibrancy makes it a prime location for businesses across various sectors. Garki truly defines convenience, prestige, and urban sophistication in Abuja.' WHERE id = 'abj-area-garki';
UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Gudu, situated in the south-central part of Abuja, is a dynamic mixed-use area renowned for its accessibility and diverse commercial landscape. It serves as an important hub for various businesses, particularly those in the automotive sector, building materials, and wholesale trade. The area is characterized by a high concentration of spare parts dealers, car dealerships, and hardware stores, making it a go-to destination for these specific needs. Beyond its robust commercial offerings, Gudu also features residential pockets, providing convenient living options for those working in the vicinity. Its strategic location near major roads ensures easy connectivity, reinforcing its role as a key commercial artery in Abuja.' WHERE id = 'abj-area-gudu';
