UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Gwarinpa, situated in the northwestern part of Abuja, is an expansive and well-established mixed-use area, widely recognized as one of the largest housing estates in Africa. It seamlessly integrates residential living with a vibrant commercial ecosystem. The district is characterized by its diverse housing options and a plethora of businesses, including major supermarkets, banks, restaurants, schools, and healthcare facilities, ensuring residents have access to all essential services. Its organized layout, coupled with a lively social scene, makes Gwarinpa a highly desirable location for families and individuals seeking a balanced urban lifestyle. It''s a community that truly caters to every need.' WHERE id = 'abj-area-gwarinpa';
UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Idu, located in the western part of Abuja, is rapidly emerging as a significant industrial and commercial hub. While still developing, it''s primarily known for its industrial layouts and serves as a key area for manufacturing, warehousing, and logistics. The Abuja Rail Mass Transit system has a major station here, enhancing its connectivity and economic potential. Businesses in Idu largely comprise factories, workshops, and large-scale enterprises, alongside supporting services like transport and logistics companies. While not predominantly residential, Idu offers a practical environment for businesses requiring accessible industrial spaces, positioning it as a crucial engine for economic growth in the FCT.' WHERE id = 'f8818f54-f763-41e3-a941-44e8cd6c91f9';
