UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'This category represents the burgeoning digital marketplace within Enugu, signifying a shift towards e-commerce across various sectors. While not a physical neighborhood, ''Online Store'' reflects a vital economic segment where businesses operate virtually, serving customers across Enugu and beyond. These stores encompass a vast range of products and services, including fashion, electronics, groceries, home goods, and bespoke services, all accessible through websites and social media platforms. They provide convenience, wider reach, and often competitive pricing, becoming an increasingly integral part of Enugu''s commercial landscape.' WHERE id = '895d707e-8312-4c46-91fa-7a1050300c92';
