UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Olorunsogo Area, positioned in the central-eastern part of Ilorin, is a vibrant and diverse mixed-use community. It seamlessly blends residential living with a thriving commercial presence. The area is known for its accessibility and numerous local businesses, including supermarkets, fashion boutiques, electronics stores, and a wide array of eateries. You''ll also find several private schools and health centers serving the dense population. Olorunsogo is a dynamic hub where daily life and commerce intertwine, offering residents convenience and entrepreneurs a bustling environment with consistent foot traffic and a broad customer base.' WHERE id = '24a571ec-fa71-45b0-8cf9-e4d6f8566cfc';
UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Omu Aran, while a significant town outside Ilorin, when referred to within Ilorin''s context, often denotes the major road or axis leading towards Omu Aran. This mixed-use corridor, particularly in the southern parts of Ilorin, is characterized by developing residential estates, educational institutions, and a growing number of commercial enterprises. Along this route, you''ll find various retail shops, fuel stations, event centers, and businesses that cater to commuters and the expanding suburban population. It serves as a vital artery, connecting Ilorin to other parts of Kwara State and fostering economic activity along its stretch.' WHERE id = '57dc434a-708a-48d3-9f14-eb5875ed9144';
