UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'GRA Jos, or Government Residential Area, is a highly esteemed mixed-use neighborhood known for its well-planned layout, leafy streets, and a blend of upscale residences and select commercial establishments. Historically home to civil servants and expatriates, it maintains an air of prestige. You''ll find a mix of spacious homes, guesthouses, reputable schools, private clinics, and high-end service providers like boutique shops and fine dining restaurants. Its central yet serene location offers excellent connectivity while providing a peaceful living environment. GRA Jos is synonymous with comfort, security, and a touch of sophistication, making it a desirable address in the city.' WHERE id = '679eee73-3434-4827-a7a2-3a9f26a35c68';
