UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Nassarawa is a prominent mixed-use district within Kano, recognized for its blend of administrative significance, residential comfort, and commercial vitality. Located centrally, it hosts numerous government offices, educational institutions, and healthcare facilities. Beyond its institutional presence, Nassarawa offers a diverse commercial landscape with supermarkets, banks, restaurants, and various service providers. Its well-planned layout and strategic positioning make it a highly sought-after area for both residents seeking convenience and businesses looking for a central, accessible location within the bustling metropolis of Kano.' WHERE id = '90e1f121-e085-4db2-a5c0-a58584402b44';
UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Nassarawa GRA (Government Residential Area) is an esteemed residential enclave, widely regarded as one of Kano''s most desirable and well-planned neighborhoods. Located adjacent to the broader Nassarawa district, it is characterized by its spacious, tree-lined streets, serene environment, and predominantly detached or semi-detached homes. While primarily residential, the area benefits from its proximity to essential amenities in nearby commercial zones. It offers a tranquil living experience, often housing civil servants, professionals, and families seeking a quiet, secure, and upscale residential setting within the vibrant city of Kano.' WHERE id = '3ca8f2c2-6f45-4194-bd11-29fe684fb5c3';
UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Nomansland is a uniquely diverse and bustling mixed-use area, famed for its cosmopolitan character and vibrant commercial activity. Located centrally, it stands out as a melting pot of cultures, attracting a wide array of businesses catering to a broad demographic. You''ll find an eclectic mix of restaurants (especially known for various cuisines), hotels, supermarkets, fashion boutiques, and entertainment spots. Its energetic atmosphere, coupled with its status as a commercial and social hub, makes Nomansland a dynamic destination for both residents and visitors seeking diverse services and a lively urban experience.' WHERE id = 'b1d2c06e-cd26-47f1-a1e6-6abddfc8c470';
UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Rangaza is a developing mixed-use area situated on the northern fringes of Kano, experiencing steady growth in both its residential and commercial sectors. As the city expands, Rangaza offers a more suburban feel while still providing necessary urban amenities. You''ll find a growing number of residential estates, alongside local markets, schools, and small businesses such as provision stores, pharmacies, and workshops. Its relatively quieter environment combined with increasing accessibility makes it an attractive location for families seeking affordable housing and entrepreneurs establishing community-focused services.' WHERE id = '0d917859-ca4d-46e5-9309-57b00748255f';
UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Rijiyar Zaki is a burgeoning residential area located in the northern part of Kano, known for its tranquil environment and increasing popularity among families and individuals seeking modern housing. While predominantly residential, the area is steadily developing its own local commercial infrastructure to serve its growing population. You''ll find a scattering of convenient stores, pharmacies, local eateries, and small service providers catering to daily needs. Its development is characterized by a mix of new housing estates and individual homes, offering a relatively peaceful living experience away from the city''s core bustle, yet still accessible to essential services.' WHERE id = '9ad68d5c-46bc-4e8f-8939-2f93a8d2fdf9';
UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Sabon Gari stands as Kano''s pulsating commercial heart, a vibrant melting pot of cultures and commerce. Strategically located within the city center, its labyrinthine streets are a hive of activity, showcasing an unparalleled density of retail outlets, wholesale markets, and diverse service providers. From electronics and textiles to automotive parts and household goods, virtually any commodity can be sourced here. The area is particularly renowned for its bustling Kwari Market, a major textile hub, and numerous hotels and restaurants catering to a constant flow of traders and visitors. Sabon Gari truly embodies the entrepreneurial spirit of Kano.' WHERE id = '122b876a-a35f-400e-8eb6-1618b957aae0';
