UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Sharada is Kano''s designated industrial powerhouse, a sprawling zone critical to the state''s manufacturing and production capabilities. Located on the city''s southwestern periphery, it hosts a wide array of factories, warehouses, and logistics operations. From textile mills and food processing plants to plastic manufacturing and engineering workshops, Sharada is where raw materials are transformed into finished goods. The area is supported by a network of ancillary services, including specialized transportation, industrial supply stores, and technical workshops, making it the bedrock of Kano''s industrial output and a significant employer.' WHERE id = '898853f2-b64c-44f3-acba-35efa9a4cd74';
UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Tarauni provides a dynamic mixed-use environment, balancing residential tranquility with accessible commercial offerings, situated conveniently in the eastern part of Kano. This area is increasingly popular for its well-planned housing estates alongside bustling local markets and a growing presence of modern retail outlets. You''ll find a range of businesses here, from supermarkets and pharmacies to educational centers and service-oriented enterprises. Tarauni''s strategic location near major thoroughfares makes it an attractive hub for both residents seeking a comfortable lifestyle and businesses looking for a well-connected base.' WHERE id = 'dcc4c784-50ca-4507-ae90-93f353ec3991';
UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Tudun Wada offers a quintessential mixed-use experience, combining established residential communities with vibrant local commerce. Positioned in the central-southern part of Kano, it''s an area known for its strong community ties and a rich array of small and medium-sized enterprises. Here, you''ll discover numerous neighborhood shops, traditional craft workshops, local eateries, and essential service providers. The area also hosts various educational institutions and religious centers, contributing to its lively and self-sufficient character. Tudun Wada embodies the spirit of a traditional Kano neighborhood, where daily needs are met within close proximity.' WHERE id = '7ab14c82-4717-40e8-8015-1f924dd04168';
