UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Wudil, though slightly further afield, functions as a vital mixed-use town within the Kano metropolitan area, particularly known for its agricultural significance and educational institutions. Located southeast of the city center, it serves as a regional hub for trade, especially for agricultural produce. Businesses here include large-scale farms, grain merchants, livestock traders, as well as a range of retail shops, financial services, and hospitality establishments catering to students and visitors. The presence of the Federal University of Technology, Wudil, adds a distinct academic and youthful vibrancy to the town''s character.' WHERE id = 'd35e5a3c-45fa-42ac-a5ef-a856f88c4cfb';
UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Yada Kunya represents a burgeoning mixed-use area, increasingly becoming a residential choice while developing its commercial footprint. Situated in the northern part of Kano, it offers a quieter alternative to the city''s more congested centers. The area is characterized by newer residential developments, alongside a growing number of local convenience stores, small markets, and service-oriented businesses like dry cleaners and salons. As infrastructure improves, Yada Kunya is attracting more residents and entrepreneurs, promising a blend of community living with accessible local amenities.' WHERE id = 'e413fc51-c67a-497c-962a-24f3dbe22323';
