UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Lafia Town represents the traditional and historical core of the city, a vibrant commercial and administrative hub that serves as the heart of Lafia. Situated centrally, it is characterized by its dense population and a rich tapestry of small and medium-sized enterprises. Here, you''ll find the main market, numerous street vendors, textile shops, electronics stores, traditional craft shops, and a plethora of local restaurants. Government offices, banks, and major transport parks are also often concentrated in this area. The energy of Lafia Town is palpable, with constant foot traffic and a lively atmosphere, making it the go-to place for everyday necessities and a true reflection of the city''s heritage and commercial spirit.' WHERE id = 'cd7c0875-95cb-48c5-87ee-37d070bdb82d';
