UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Lagos City, often referring to the historical and administrative heart of Lagos Island, is an iconic and bustling metropolitan center. This area is predominantly commercial, serving as a major financial hub with numerous banks, corporate headquarters, and government institutions. It''s also a vibrant retail district, home to large markets like Balogun and Idumota, alongside modern shopping complexes. While commercial activity dominates, pockets of traditional residential areas and historical landmarks, such as the National Museum and Freedom Park, offer glimpses into its rich past. Its central location and extensive transport network make it a focal point for business, tourism, and cultural exchange, embodying the ceaseless energy of Lagos.' WHERE id = '83c480f1-f35d-4577-9024-30ce7de86cb7';
UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Lagos Island stands as the historical and commercial nucleus of Lagos, a vibrant tapestry woven with colonial architecture, bustling markets, and towering modern structures. Primarily a commercial district, it hosts the headquarters of numerous banks, financial institutions, and government offices. Iconic markets like Balogun and Idumota draw traders and shoppers from across the city, offering everything from textiles to electronics. While less residential than other areas, it retains pockets of traditional homes and significant historical landmarks such as the Brazilian Quarters and Freedom Park. Its strategic location, connected by bridges to the mainland, makes it an indispensable hub for business, culture, and daily commerce, pulsating with an unmatched energy.' WHERE id = '744255bd-33f3-568e-abab-10e96da59498';
