UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Maitumbi is a sprawling and rapidly developing residential area in Minna, known for its community feel and diverse housing options. Situated towards the eastern part of the city, it offers a mix of established homes and newer developments. While largely residential, it supports a growing commercial ecosystem comprising local markets, pharmacies, small retail shops, schools, and various service providers that cater to the daily needs of its expanding population. Maitumbi is an ideal location for businesses seeking to tap into a growing residential market with a need for accessible goods and services.' WHERE id = '710a873a-1d33-43f3-864a-705b132cfb97';
UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Minna Central stands as the undisputed commercial heart of the city, a vibrant and bustling hub of economic activity. Positioned strategically, it is easily accessible from all parts of Minna. This area is characterized by a high concentration of banks, major retail outlets, corporate offices, government institutions, and a diverse array of businesses ranging from electronics stores to fashion boutiques and restaurants. It''s the go-to destination for significant transactions and extensive shopping, making it the prime location for businesses aiming for maximum visibility, high foot traffic, and broad market reach.' WHERE id = '26d5b68e-91d2-4560-9f97-ae2bad1e9788';
