UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'While ''No 4'' isn''t a widely recognized formal neighborhood name in Port Harcourt, it often refers to specific sections or addresses within larger districts that have developed their own distinct character. These ''No 4'' areas, typically found along major roads or within older residential layouts, tend to be highly mixed-use. Expect to find a vibrant blend of residential buildings, small-scale commercial activities like provisions stores, tailoring shops, and local eateries. They often serve as convenient local hubs, providing essential services to the immediate community and reflecting the organic growth of Port Harcourt''s urban fabric.' WHERE id = '16624079-2649-463e-9719-8946b913a1c0';
