UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Old G.R.A, a historic and distinguished residential area in Port Harcourt, exudes an air of established tranquility. Characterized by its tree-lined streets and well-maintained properties, it offers a serene escape from the city''s bustle. While predominantly residential, you''ll find a select number of high-end service businesses, including private schools, boutique hotels, and upscale restaurants catering to its affluent residents. Its proximity to government institutions and other key facilities adds to its appeal. Old G.R.A is synonymous with comfort, security, and a refined lifestyle, making it a coveted address within the city.' WHERE id = 'f346603a-880c-499d-8a7f-d3640c7f11c6';
