UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'The general Port Harcourt urban area, often colloquially referred to as ''Port Hacourt'' (a common misspelling), encompasses a vast and diverse mixed-use landscape. As the capital of Rivers State, it''s a major economic hub, known for its significant commercial activities, particularly in oil and gas, alongside a dense residential population. Businesses here span the entire spectrum, from multinational corporations to vibrant local markets, financial institutions, and a robust service sector. It''s the pulsating heart of the region, characterized by constant activity and a rich blend of cultures and commerce.' WHERE id = '4ae17cef-512e-4692-b4f4-21c69d0698dd';
UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Port Harcour, a common phonetic rendering of Port Harcourt, refers to the sprawling mixed-use metropolis at large. This vibrant city is a pivotal commercial and administrative center in the Niger Delta, driven by its oil and gas industry and a diverse economy. Its landscape is a rich tapestry of residential districts, bustling commercial hubs, and industrial zones. Businesses of all scales thrive here, from large corporations to small enterprises, offering a wide array of goods and services. It''s a city defined by its energy, its people, and its strategic importance to Nigeria''s economy.' WHERE id = '17b41d4a-c8d4-4d6a-9fb2-d818dc5515b5';
