UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Port Harcourt 500272 typically corresponds to a mixed-use area within Port Harcourt that might be less central than the 5001xx codes, often indicating a more suburban yet still vibrant character. This zone likely features a strong residential component, with new and established housing developments, supported by a growing commercial infrastructure. Businesses here cater to the local community, including supermarkets, schools, healthcare clinics, and various small-to-medium enterprises. It offers a balance of residential tranquility with convenient access to essential services and amenities, appealing to families and local entrepreneurs.' WHERE id = '79d96a09-a72d-41a9-95f4-77840336a061';
