UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'The Old City, or Birni, is the historical heart of Sokoto, representing a unique mixed-use environment steeped in tradition and culture. Located centrally, it is defined by its ancient architecture, narrow winding streets, and a strong sense of heritage. This area is a vibrant hub for traditional commerce, housing numerous local markets, artisan workshops, and small businesses dealing in textiles, local crafts, and traditional goods. Residential life here is deeply intertwined with the commercial activity, fostering a close-knit community. The Birni is not just a place of business; it''s a living museum, featuring landmarks like the Sultan''s Palace and historical mosques, offering an authentic glimpse into Sokoto''s rich past.' WHERE id = '41379296-5fe2-41f1-a868-37fef65057f0';
UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'Rijiya is a mixed-use neighborhood that balances residential living with accessible local commerce, situated within a developing part of Sokoto. This area is characterized by a blend of homes and a growing assortment of small businesses, catering to the immediate needs of its inhabitants. You''ll encounter various local shops, provision stores, service outlets like barbershops and tailors, and modest eateries. Its character is one of a self-sufficient community, where daily essentials are within easy reach. Rijiya offers a practical and community-focused environment, reflecting the ongoing expansion and development of Sokoto''s urban fabric.' WHERE id = '31e63085-70a8-4041-a5ed-3256b1762b2b';
UPDATE areas SET seo_description = 'The Sokoto Central Market Area is the undisputed commercial nerve center of the city, a bustling and vibrant hub located in the heart of Sokoto. This area is entirely dedicated to trade and commerce, drawing in thousands of shoppers and traders daily. Here, you''ll find an extensive array of goods, from fresh produce, textiles, and electronics to household items and building materials. It''s a place where virtually every business type thrives, from large wholesalers to individual hawkers. The market''s immense scale and constant activity make it a landmark in itself, essential for the economic life of Sokoto and its surrounding regions.' WHERE id = '4d4a9f9a-2bbd-4976-88a5-c0ca7a1689b2';
